# display_guest_state_values: The state word is guest-writable. A value other than 0-2 is a "bogus state", handled as 2: with a nonzero guest mode count it resends (12) even when nothing changed; with a mode count of 0 and no pending list it disconnects (8). A guest state 1 with nothing pending moves on to 2. Interrupt totals count the stamps' too.
